<title>USA: Smith Barney Municipal sets three divs.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney Municipal sets three divs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Municipal Fund said it set a monthly dividend of $0.071 per share for January, February and March.</p>
<p>Respective pay dates are January 31 1997 for stockholders of record January 28 1997; February 28 1997 for stockholders of records February 25 1997 and March 27 1997 for stockholders of record March 24 1997.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Municipal Fund is a non-diversified close-end management investment company.</p>
</text>
